# --- IDA Pro database files -------------------------------------------------
# These are the volatile per-session database shards. We keep the packed
# .i64 (commit it explicitly) so analysts can resume from a known state.
*.id0
*.id1
*.id2
*.nam
*.til
*.idb
# Uncomment the next line if you do NOT want the packed IDB tracked:
# *.i64

